{#
    "Who can enter: …" in the byline of the series, edition and event pages (owner: workstream C,
    docs/features/organizations/README.md "Who can enter"): the organiser's own words, as typed.

    Variables: eligibility (null|string) - an edition passes its own, else its series'.
#}
{%- if eligibility is not empty -%}
    <span class="ev-detail-by ev-detail-eligibility" data-eligibility>{{ 'organization.byline.who_can_enter'|trans({'%text%': eligibility}) }}</span>
{%- endif -%}
